The scholarship directory content in this directory is authored by
collegedata.fyi: the selection and arrangement of programs, the structured
record format and normalized values, the JSON Schema, and the descriptions
and summaries written for each record. It is distinct from both the
MIT-licensed source code of this repository and the underlying program terms
(which belong to the schools and foundations that publish them).

