Attribution string (use this form everywhere):

  Scholarship program data from collegedata.fyi (https://collegedata.fyi/scholarships), CC BY-SA 4.0. Terms as published by each school; see the source link on each record.

What this license does not cover

The license covers only what collegedata.fyi authored, as listed above. It
does not cover, and collegedata.fyi does not claim rights in:

  - the schools' and foundations' own web pages, PDFs and other documents;
  - quoted excerpts from those sources (records keep excerpts to 25 words or
    fewer, which is a house policy and not a legal safe harbor);
  - trademarks, names and logos of schools, foundations and programs;
  - archived or saved copies of source pages and PDFs, which are not
    redistributed here;
  - text from third-party scholarship directories, which are used only as
    leads and are never copied.

Bare facts such as a deadline or a dollar amount are not protected by US
copyright. This license binds the compilation and the writing, not each
individual fact. Program terms change; the source link on each record is the
authority, not this file.

Everything outside this directory remains under the repository's MIT
license (see /LICENSE) unless stated otherwise.
